# SPDX-License-Identifier: MPL-2.0
import lib/cadkernel/acis_history_frames.dl

function check history {boolean:condition}:
    execute:
        if condition = false:
            @intrinsic("call", "libc", "abort", nothing)

function history vector {cad vector3:first} equals {cad vector3:second}:
    execute:
        return ((first's x = second's x) and (first's y = second's y)) and (first's z = second's z)

function a history identity transform:
    execute:
        set values to an empty list of a 64 bit floating-point number
        append 1.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 1.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 1.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 0.0 to values
        append 1.0 to values
        return values

set matrix to a history identity transform
set parsed to the cad history placement of matrix
check history parsed's valid
check history (parsed's failure = 0)
check history (parsed's value = the cad identity placement)
print "placement_identity" as a line

replace item at index 3 in matrix with 2e-9
check history (parsed's value = the cad identity placement)
set refused to the cad history placement of matrix
check history (refused's valid = false)
check history (refused's failure = 1)
print "placement_refuses_bad_homogeneous_column" as a line
free matrix
set shortMatrix to an empty list of a 64 bit floating-point number
append 1.0 to shortMatrix
check history ((the cad history placement of shortMatrix)'s valid = false)
free shortMatrix

set frame to the cad history ocs plane with normal (the cad z axis) and elevation 4.0
check history frame's valid
check history ((frame's value's origin's z) = 4.0)
set emptyFrame to the cad history ocs plane with normal (the cad zero vector3) and elevation 4.0
check history (emptyFrame's valid = false)
check history (emptyFrame's failure = 2)
print "ocs_axis_and_zero_refusal" as a line

set start to a cad vector3 with x 1.0, y 2.0 and z 3.0
set end to a cad vector3 with x 4.0, y 6.0 and z 3.0
set lineResult to the cad history straight curve from start to end
check history lineResult's valid
check history (history vector (the cad point on lineResult's value at 0.0) equals start)
check history (history vector (the cad point on lineResult's value at 1.0) equals end)
set short to the cad history straight curve from start to start
check history (short's valid = false)
check history (short's failure = 2)
print "straight_curve_and_short_refusal" as a line

set outer to a cad placement at (a cad vector3 with x 5.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0)
set inner to a cad placement at (a cad vector3 with x 0.0, y 7.0 and z 0.0)
set combined to the cad history composition of outer and inner
check history (history vector combined's origin equals (a cad vector3 with x 5.0, y 7.0 and z 0.0))
set matrix to a history identity transform
replace item at index 12 in matrix with 5.0
set placed to the cad history placed curve lineResult's value by matrix
check history placed's valid
check history (placed's failure = 0)
check history (history vector (the cad point on placed's value at 0.0) equals (a cad vector3 with x 6.0, y 2.0 and z 3.0))
replace item at index 4 in matrix with 0.25
set sheared to the cad history placed curve lineResult's value by matrix
check history (sheared's valid = false)
check history (sheared's failure = 1)
free matrix
print "composition_and_curve_placement" as a line

set vertices to an empty list of a cad polyline vertex2
append (a straight cad polyline vertex2 at (a cad vector2 with x 0.0 and y 0.0)) to vertices
append (a straight cad polyline vertex2 at (a cad vector2 with x 2.0 and y 0.0)) to vertices
set path to the cad polyline2 with vertices vertices and closure false
free vertices
set source to a cad planar curve3 of (the cad curve2 of path) on (the cad xy plane)
free cad polyline path
set matrix to a history identity transform
replace item at index 12 in matrix with 5.0
set moved to the cad history placed curve source by matrix
check history moved's valid
check history (source's plane's origin's x = 0.0)
set retained to moved's value
set moved to the cad history straight curve from (the cad zero vector3) to (the cad zero vector3)
free cad planar curve source
check history ((the length of retained's curve's polyline's vertices) = 2)
set cloned to the cad clone of retained
free cad planar curve retained
check history ((the length of cloned's curve's polyline's vertices) = 2)
loop cycle from 0 to 100:
    set borrowed to the cad history placed curve cloned by matrix
    check history borrowed's valid
    check history ((the length of borrowed's value's curve's polyline's vertices) = 2)
free cad planar curve cloned
free matrix
print "ownership_and_borrowed_inputs" as a line
